[10.6698, "o", "\u001b[38;5;208m● belay\u001b[0m\r\n  Hey — good to see you. Honestly, two days since onboarding barely counts as \"away.\" Nothing's broken: onboarding finished clean, categories and transfers are all set up right, and there's already a draft budget sitting for August.\r\n\r\n  The actual gap is simpler than it feels: no July bank exports have come in yet, so July is just... not in the system. Not a missed thing, just an empty one.\r\n\r\n  Want the small version? If your bank will give you a statement covering July so far, drop it in `finance/inbox/` (same naming as before — `main_2026-07.csv` / `credit_2026-07.xlsx`) and I'll fold it in, few minutes, and you'll have a real picture of July instead of a guess. If July's statement isn't ready yet, that's completely fine too — we can just pick up clean at August 1.\r\n\r\n  Either way works. And if this is enough for today, that's also completely fine.\r\n\r\n\u001b[1;36malex ▸ \u001b[0m"]
